{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/848572-index-of-mummies","id":848572,"title":"Index of Mummies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-16T20:03:18-07:00","id":848572,"title":"Index of Mummies","content":"Mummy, by its very nature, is a story of history, so sometimes you end up seeing different characters in different stages of their lives. Also by that same nature, its not an easy game to wrap you head around the names all the time. I've found it difficult to keep track to characters across multiple books and I figure others have done the same. To help us out, I'm going to start listing the named Mummies we've encountered in different books with page references so I can find them easily again and so that I can recognize any that show up in Dark Eras. This will very much be a work in progress, so if you want to post something that I've missed or haven't got to, feel free and I will add it to the list.<br /> <br /> *******<br /> <u>Unaligned</u><ul><li><b>The Heretic (former Sesha-Hebsu, former Su-Menent)</b> - <i>Core</i>: Pg 30, 174; <i>Chronicles</i> (all of it); <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 116</li> <li><b>Sharifa, the Forgotten</b> - Rio</li> </ul><u>Maa-Kep</u><ul><li><b>Aapep Medes, the Moon Snake (Second personality: The Viridian Vizier)</b> - Rio</li> <li><b>Bes-Mat</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: pg 140</li> <li><b>Beset Khered, the Progenitor of Duality (Worshipped as Oxumare) </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Chatuluka, the Drowned Princess</b> - Rio</li> <li><b>The Diarist (former Sesha-Hebsu, possibly returned to that guild)</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 11</li> <li><b>Khyan, The Unsurpassed (former guildmaster of Europe)</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i> Pg 100-101</li> <li><b>Nekhakha, the Flail of Eternity </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Osorehe, the Basalt Tower of Forgotten Dreams (guildmaster, worshiped as Ogoun) </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Pestem-Aah, A Senhora de Pesar (Lady of Regret, guildmaster of SA)</b> - <i>Guildhalls:</i> Pg 16, 101</li> <li><b>Sabola</b><b> (</b><b>Khent</b><b>-</b><b>henu</b><b>) </b>- <i>DC</i>: pg 24</li> <li><b>Sefet-Qam (Signature Maa-Kep, former guildmaster of Africa)</b> - <i>Core</i><i>:</i> pp. 2-5, 12, 33 (illustration); <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 14</li> <li><b>Ta-Em-Sertu (guildmaster of NA)</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: pg 15-16</li> <li><b>Tausret, Who Binds the Gaze of Men (guildmaster of Europe)</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: pg 99-100</li> </ul><u>Mesen-Nebu</u><ul><li><b>Kanika</b> - <i>DC</i>: pg 24</li> <li><b>Khons-Neb-Ankh, Master of the Paths of Life </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Merew-Tjaw, The Anointed One (Signature Mesen-Nebu)</b> - <i>Core</i>: pg 140; <i>Deceived</i>: 2-3, 5; <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 104-106</li> <li><b>Tarikh-Sethos (</b><b>Khent</b><b>-</b><b>henu</b><b>)</b> - <i>DC</i>: pg 24</li> <li><b>Tashakti</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: pg 140</li> <li><b>Teshra-Gemet</b><b>, O Pardal Vermelho (Guildmaster)</b> - <i>Core</i>: pg 256-257, <i>Rio</i></li> </ul><u>Sesha-Hebsu</u><ul><li><b>Akhomet</b> - <i>Deceived</i>: pg 157-158</li> <li><b>Antu-Herap, Prince of Glass (Signature Sesha-Hebsu)</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 115-117</li> <li><b>Bantanath, the Artificer of Secrets (Guildmaster, second personality: The Scarlet Queen) </b> - Rio</li> <li><b>Hes-Sedjet, the Empress of Azure Waves (Worshiped as Iemanja) </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Sa-Khonsu, the Oubliette of Flowers (Second personality: The Ebon Princess) </b>- Rio</li> <li><b>Su-Thoth </b>- <i>Deceived: </i>pp. 139-140</li> <li>T<b>arset, Hand of Antu-Herap</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 117-119</li> <li><b>Tawret</b> - <i>Guildhalls</i>: Pg 140, 143-144</li> <li><b>Ur-Qeb (Khent-henu)</b> - <i>DC</i>: pg 11, 24; <i>Sothis</i>: pg 67</li> </ul><u>Su-Menent</u><ul><li><b>Ankh-Nephris, Hand of Wisdom (Signature Su-Menent)</b> - <i>Core: </i>pp. 15, 48 (illustration), 272-276</li> <li><b>Hus