e":"2017-02-23T08:52:30-08:00","id":1053840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/848572-index-of-mummies?p=1053836#post1053836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which book are they from?</div> </div> </div> </div>He's mentioned in Guildhalls of the Deathless, but I don't see any stats for him there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T02:06:45-08:00","id":1054234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/848572-index-of-mummies?p=1053840#post1053840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He's mentioned in Guildhalls of the Deathless, but I don't see any stats for him there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, there are quite a few that fit that boat. Hence why I made sure to put the first Sharifa reference in this thread...I didn't think we'd get more information on her. I was wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T16:33:07-08:00","id":1054501,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I only mentioned him because First Prophets are major plothooks for their whole continent. I really wish we had stats for Menmaatre. I seem to recall the book mentioning that he was somewhat less powerful than other mummies at the grand conclave. Which to me sounds odd, but not impossible. It could've even just been referencing his current sekhem at the time the Avarice Chronicle starts. If not, maybe he hasn't been awake very often and is closer to a starting mummy than mummies who've spent more lifetimes up and about learning utterances and raising stats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T17:29:53-08:00","id":1054525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/848572-index-of-mummies?p=1054501#post1054501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I only mentioned him because First Prophets are major plothooks for their whole continent. I really wish we had stats for Menmaatre. I seem to recall the book mentioning that he was somewhat less powerful than other mummies at the grand conclave. Which to me sounds odd, but not impossible. It could've even just been referencing his current sekhem at the time the Avarice Chronicle starts. If not, maybe he hasn't been awake very often and is closer to a starting mummy than mummies who've spent more lifetimes up and about learning utterances and raising stats.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, now that I've hunted him down in Guildhalls, I realize why I missed him. I had originally not included the Chronicles at the end of the book, which I have since changed my tune about. I'll get Menmaatre in ASAP.<br /> <br /> <b>EDIT</b>: Okay, I've added everyone from the Personae Cheat Sheet, although I will have to track them down with search for all the references.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=